{"id":"e_volution","lemma":"évolution","pos":"noun","rank":3306,"glosses":["evolution"],"ipa":"/e.vɔ.ly.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/59/Fr-l%27%C3%A9volution.ogg/Fr-l%27%C3%A9volution.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"évolutions"},"formAudio":{"évolutions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9volutions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le monde est en constante évolution.","en":"The world is always changing.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"world"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"constant"},null]},{"text":"Suivez l'évolution de vos finances.","en":"Keep track of your finances.","words":[{"g":"to follow","l":"suivre"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},{"g":"finance","l":"finance"}]},{"text":"Darwin a élaboré la théorie de l'évolution.","en":"Darwin developed the evolutionary theory.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to draw up","l":"élaborer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"theory"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Il y a eu une évolution significative dans l'affaire du bambin disparu.","en":"There's been a significant development in the case of the missing toddler.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"significant, important","l":"significatif"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"business"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"toddler"},{"g":"disappeared"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Nous associons le nom de Darwin à la théorie de l'évolution.","en":"We associate the name of Darwin with the theory of evolution.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"name"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,null,{"g":"theory"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"a la"]]}]}